        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>For Humanity </strong>is an intense cooperative extraction FPS, mixing survival, exploration and tactical combat. Dive into a post-apocalyptic world ravaged by a pandemic and infested with zombies, where each release is a struggle to stay alive. Play alone or up to 4 players to explore dangerous areas, recover rare resources and escape to your camp. Between expeditions, manage your equipment and weapons to increase your chances of survival, while helping other survivors uncover the mystery behind the origin of the pandemic. Every decision matters: every area visited, every encounter and every fight can decide your fate.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Cooperative FPS up to 4 players</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter a post-apocalyptic world where survival depends on your coordination. Play as a team with up to three friends to explore dangerous areas, face hordes of zombies. Each expedition requires strategy, communication and reflection.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4041280/extras/e82b9e945ff68ff1543a568ab4561511.poster.avif?t=1765191637\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4041280/extras/e82b9e945ff68ff1543a568ab4561511.webm?t=1765191637\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4041280/extras/e82b9e945ff68ff1543a568ab4561511.mp4?t=1765191637\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>You can join or create games with your friends, each player has a role and an individual inventory. Cooperation is essential to explore the most dangerous areas and survive unexpected encounters.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >High risk extraction</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recover valuable resources in hostile environments. Every mission is a bet: the more you risk, the more you can win, but beware, death means losing everything. The tension is constant, and every decision can be decisive for your survival. Treasure the equipment you bring back in addition to be able to quickly re-equip yourself and leave to explore or help your friends in difficulty.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4041280/extras/698e3b1aa3587cc400727f58c79c42f6.poster.avif?t=1765191637\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4041280/extras/698e3b1aa3587cc400727f58c79c42f6.webm?t=1765191637\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4041280/extras/698e3b1aa3587cc400727f58c79c42f6.mp4?t=1765191637\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>You collect resources and objects that you must extract before dying. If you are eliminated before extraction, you lose everything. This mechanism encourages choosing between prudent exploration or risk-taking for greater gains.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Survivors' camp </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between expeditions, find your safe camp where you can rest and reorganize your equipment. It is the starting point for your missions, the place to plan your outings and prepare your team to face the dangers of the outside world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4041280/extras/a7be024f201a5bdac7038dc08adf414b.poster.avif?t=1765191637\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4041280/extras/a7be024f201a5bdac7038dc08adf414b.webm?t=1765191637\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4041280/extras/a7be024f201a5bdac7038dc08adf414b.mp4?t=1765191637\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The camp serves as a hub to manage your inventory, equip your weapons, and prepare your shipments. You will find your secure items and can decide which equipment you will take with you on your next outing. It is also here that you will find all the settlements and interactions, and the tracking of your quests.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Customizable weapons and equipment </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adapt your weapons and equipment to your play style and the challenges ahead. Add attachments, upgrade your weapons and equip yourself strategically to maximize your chances of survival. Every modification can make the difference during the most perilous missions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4041280/extras/378ba9aa8c62f77508573f5876fd98cd.poster.avif?t=1765191637\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4041280/extras/378ba9aa8c62f77508573f5876fd98cd.webm?t=1765191637\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4041280/extras/378ba9aa8c62f77508573f5876fd98cd.mp4?t=1765191637\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Each weapon can be equipped with several attachments (glasses, chargers, lamp...), and you can configure your arsenal before each mission. Equipment choices directly influence your combat effectiveness and ability to survive in varied environments.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>For Humanity </strong>is an intense cooperative extraction FPS, mixing survival, exploration and tactical combat. Dive into a post-apocalyptic world ravaged by a pandemic and infested with zombies, where each release is a struggle to stay alive. Play alone or up to 4 players to explore dangerous areas, recover rare resources and escape to your camp. Between expeditions, manage your equipment and weapons to increase your chances of survival, while helping other survivors uncover the mystery behind the origin of the pandemic. Every decision matters: every area visited, every encounter and every fight can decide your fate.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Cooperative FPS up to 4 players</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter a post-apocalyptic world where survival depends on your coordination. Play as a team with up to three friends to explore dangerous areas, face hordes of zombies. Each expedition requires strategy, communication and reflection.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4041280/extras/e82b9e945ff68ff1543a568ab4561511.poster.avif?t=1765191637\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4041280/extras/e82b9e945ff68ff1543a568ab4561511.webm?t=1765191637\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4041280/extras/e82b9e945ff68ff1543a568ab4561511.mp4?t=1765191637\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>You can join or create games with your friends, each player has a role and an individual inventory. Cooperation is essential to explore the most dangerous areas and survive unexpected encounters.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >High risk extraction</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recover valuable resources in hostile environments. Every mission is a bet: the more you risk, the more you can win, but beware, death means losing everything. The tension is constant, and every decision can be decisive for your survival. Treasure the equipment you bring back in addition to be able to quickly re-equip yourself and leave to explore or help your friends in difficulty.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4041280/extras/698e3b1aa3587cc400727f58c79c42f6.poster.avif?t=1765191637\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4041280/extras/698e3b1aa3587cc400727f58c79c42f6.webm?t=1765191637\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4041280/extras/698e3b1aa3587cc400727f58c79c42f6.mp4?t=1765191637\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>You collect resources and objects that you must extract before dying. If you are eliminated before extraction, you lose everything. This mechanism encourages choosing between prudent exploration or risk-taking for greater gains.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Survivors' camp </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between expeditions, find your safe camp where you can rest and reorganize your equipment. It is the starting point for your missions, the place to plan your outings and prepare your team to face the dangers of the outside world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4041280/extras/a7be024f201a5bdac7038dc08adf414b.poster.avif?t=1765191637\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4041280/extras/a7be024f201a5bdac7038dc08adf414b.webm?t=1765191637\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4041280/extras/a7be024f201a5bdac7038dc08adf414b.mp4?t=1765191637\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The camp serves as a hub to manage your inventory, equip your weapons, and prepare your shipments. You will find your secure items and can decide which equipment you will take with you on your next outing. It is also here that you will find all the settlements and interactions, and the tracking of your quests.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Customizable weapons and equipment </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adapt your weapons and equipment to your play style and the challenges ahead. Add attachments, upgrade your weapons and equip yourself strategically to maximize your chances of survival. Every modification can make the difference during the most perilous missions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4041280/extras/378ba9aa8c62f77508573f5876fd98cd.poster.avif?t=1765191637\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4041280/extras/378ba9aa8c62f77508573f5876fd98cd.webm?t=1765191637\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4041280/extras/378ba9aa8c62f77508573f5876fd98cd.mp4?t=1765191637\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Each weapon can be equipped with several attachments (glasses, chargers, lamp...), and you can configure your arsenal before each mission. Equipment choices directly influence your combat effectiveness and ability to survive in varied environments.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>",
